+# SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
+#
+# IMX376 (OnePlus 6T second rear camera). Colour matrices borrowed from the IMX519.
+# The analogue gain is capped at 8x: at 16x the read noise is five
+# times that at 1x (measured on the IMX371) and shows as coloured grain,
+# a darker picture looks better.
+# The white balance gains may go up to 8x: under warm indoor light the blue
+# channel is weaker than a quarter of green, and the default 4x ceiling left
+# the picture yellow.
+# gainBias corrects the grey world white point: on the same scenes as the
+# IMX519 (with its CCM) the blue to green ratio was 0.59 against 0.9..1.0
+# at every brightness, red about 4 % higher (photos of 02.10.2026). Not a
+# lab calibration.
+%YAML 1.1
+---
+version: 1
+algorithms:
+  - BlackLevel:
+  - Awb:
+      maxGain: 8.0
+      gainBias: [ 0.96, 1.5 ]
+  # Not calibrated for this sensor: the matrices of the IMX519 (Sony
+  # colour filters as well) until a calibration of its own. Without a CCM
+  # the colours were faded and the shadows grey.
+  - Ccm:
+      ccms:
+        - ct: 2890
+          ccm: [ 1.3675, -0.1845, -0.1831,
+                 -0.3236, 1.4483, -0.1247,
